## Why choose our Drum Sing Dance program?

With so many different countries, instruments and dances to choose from, we guarantee you and your children fun and entertainment. At the same time, children learn about the amazingly diverse cultures that live in West Africa.

For this reason, our Drum Sing Dance program is the best way for your children to have an exciting, interactive and multicultural experience. What’s more, there are five different workshops to choose from, so we have your programs and incursions covered for the entire year.

In addition, booking multiple incursions gives you fantastic savings.
{% /column %}

