{% /columns %}

{% section tone="grey" %}
*Program benefits*

## Drum Sing Dance program benefits

All of these benefits are part of our Drum Sing Dance program. Even better, children experience them in a fun, playful and engaging way.

- **Musical:** Children drum, sing and also play lots of instruments.
- **Physical:** Dancing also builds coordination and spatial awareness.
- **Interactive:** Every child has an instrument, so everyone plays.
- **Educational:** Children also practise counting, language, listening and following directions.
- **Social:** Teamwork and communication then build connection and community.
- **Cultural:** Stories and play bring African culture to life, so learning feels natural.
- **Creative:** Thinking, playing and movement all come together.
{% /section %}

